      "role": "user",
      "content": "but there's no point in talking to people because they'll never actually get it. they'll just respect me or pity me, but they'll never actually see me. it feels like i'm just stuck in this loop of being exhausted and lonely forever. like it's just an endless cycle of trying and failing to belong.",
