      "content": "it's just so exhausting. every day is just more of the same. sometimes i look at the world and it just feels like i wasn't even meant to be part of it. like, if everything is just constant effort and never truly feeling seen, is there even a reason to keep trying to force it? it feels like there's no end to the exhaustion.",
